BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (5 Discussion) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (A language model is trained on one job: given the tokens so far, say what comes next. That job) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (needs no labels beyond plain text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (The question this report asks is whether such a model, given enough text and enough capacity,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (starts doing tasks nobody trained it for, once the task is described in the prompt.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (To a degree it does. Reading comprehension, summarisation and translation all improve without) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (any change to the parameters or the architecture for each task.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (What a Corpus Teaches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (18) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
