43 0 obj
<< /Length 801 >>
stream
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 760 Td (5.1 Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 738 Td (The model and the training loop are kept as plain as possible; the effort goes into the corpus,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 724 Td (which is assembled with a simple rule for finding pages a person would actually read.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 710 Td (Each evaluation writes its input as a prompt in ordinary language, and the answer is whatever) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 696 Td (the model continues with. Nothing is trained on the task itself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 682 Td (Results are reported on the usual benchmarks for each task, beside systems that were trained) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 668 Td (on that task's labels where such numbers exist.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 780 Td (What a Corpus Teaches) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (19) Tj ET
endstream
